@startuml
' Reservation subdiagram
title Finalize reservation
autonumber
hide footbox
actor Customer as User
control "controller : ReservationController" as Controller
note over User, Controller
Selection and quote are ready; customer is authenticated.
This subdiagram shows the successful path.
end note
User -> Controller : confirmBooking()
Controller -> Controller : checkAndHoldAvailability(selection)
note right of Controller : Successful availability check assumed.
alt PREPAY
User -> Controller : submitPayment(paymentToken)
Controller -> Controller : processPayment(quotedPrice, paymentToken)
note right of Controller
External payment integration is omitted.
Continue only after verified payment success.
end note
create participant "payment : Payment" as Payment
|||
Controller -> Payment : <<create>>(quotedPrice, paidAt,\nRENTAL_CHARGE)
else PAY_AT_PICKUP
note right of Controller : No Payment object is created yet.
end
create participant "reservation : Reservation" as Reservation
Controller -> Reservation : <<create>>(customer, location, category, dates,\ninsurances, options, paymentOption,\nquotedPrice, CONFIRMED)
opt PREPAY
Controller -> Reservation : addPayment(payment)
end
Reservation --> Controller : booking confirmation
note over User, Controller
The overview shows delivery of confirmation to the user.
end note
@enduml
